#. type: Plain text
#: sections/deckbuilding.tex:73
msgid ""
"\\pagetarget{Statistic}{}\\pagetarget{Ability}{} \\subheader{Statistic and "
"Ability Cards}"
msgstr ""
"\\pagetarget{Statistic}{}\\pagetarget{Ability}{} \\subheader{Cartes "
"Caractéristique et Compétence}"

#. type: multicols
#: sections/deckbuilding.tex:78
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All Statistic\\index{Statistic cards} and Ability cards\\index{Ability cards} have a \\textbf{Basic Effect}\\index{Basic Effect} and a stronger \\textbf{Expert Effect} \\svg{expert}\\index{Expert Effect}, which is shown below the Basic Effect.\n"
"Whenever you play a Statistic or Ability card, you must choose which effect you are using.\n"
"The number of \\svg{expert} Effects you can use each Round is limited by your Main Hero's \\pagelink{Level}{Level}.\n"
"Track the number of uses you have in any suitable manner, such as by moving Black Cubes on and off your Hero Board.\\par\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Chaque carte Caractéristique\\index{Statistic cards} ou Compétence\\index{Ability cards} a un \\textbf{effet Basique}\\index{Basic Effect} et un \\textbf{effet Expert} \\svg{expert}\\index{Expert Effect} plus fort, dessous ; choisissez-en un.\n"
"\n"
"Le \\pagelink{Level}{niveau} du Héros principal limite les effets \\svg{expert} par manche\n"
"(suivez-les avec des cubes noirs).\\par\n"
"\n"

#. type: multicols
#: sections/deckbuilding.tex:86
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"\\note{11.5}{\n"
"  \\wikilink{abilities/necromancy}{Necromancy cards} are limited to the Necropolis Faction \\svg{necro-yellow}.\n"
"  When a non-Necropolis player draws a Necropolis-specific card\\index{Necropolis card} from the Ability Deck, they may either discard it and draw a new card as a replacement or gain it.\n"
"  Non-Necropolis players \\textbf{cannot use} Necropolis-specific cards from their hand in any way besides for effects that discard them.\n"
"}"
msgstr ""
"\\note{6.5}{\n"
"  Les \\wikilink{abilities/necromancy}{cartes Nécromancie} sont réservées à la Nécropole \\svg{necro-yellow} ;\n"
"  les autres factions les défaussent ou les gardent\\index{Necropolis card},\n"
"  sans \\textbf{pouvoir les utiliser}.\n"
"}"

